# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Qiskit bosons"
msgstr "Petunjuk instalasi untuk versi terbaru Qiskit bosons"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Petunjuk instalasi"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Petunjuk instalasi {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This page explains how to install the Python API. A C API is not available for this package yet.\n"
msgstr "Halaman ini menjelaskan cara menginstal Python API. C API belum tersedia untuk paket ini.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prasyarat {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. Use [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Pertama, buat environment minimal yang hanya berisi Python. Gunakan [virtual environment Python](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktifkan environment barumu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package: from PyPI or from source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Ada dua cara utama untuk menginstal paket ini: dari PyPI atau dari source. Cara yang disarankan adalah menginstal dari PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Instal dari PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Instal dari source {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository you should install from source.\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu berencana mengembangkan di dalam repositori, instal dari source.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, Qiskit must be installed in the same Python environment that you install `qiskit-bosons` in. The simplest way to do this is from PyPI, but you can install Qiskit from source if you want to.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, Qiskit harus terinstal di environment Python yang sama dengan tempat kamu menginstal `qiskit-bosons`. Cara paling mudah adalah dari PyPI, tapi kamu juga bisa menginstal Qiskit dari source kalau mau.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, clone the `qiskit-bosons` repository.\n"
msgstr "Selanjutnya, clone repositori `qiskit-bosons`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now, install the Rust toolchain, upgrade pip, and enter the repository. Refer to the [Rust documentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) for instructions on installing the toolchain.\n"
msgstr "Sekarang, instal toolchain Rust, upgrade pip, lalu masuk ke repositori. Lihat [dokumentasi Rust](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) untuk petunjuk menginstal toolchain.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the remaining `build` dependencies. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Instal dependensi `build` yang tersisa. Kalau kamu berencana mengembangkan di dalam repositori, instal juga dependensi `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-bosons` to the virtual environment.\n"
msgstr "Langkah berikutnya adalah menginstal `qiskit-bosons` ke virtual environment.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Hint\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Petunjuk\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can also perform an editable install while still compiling the underlying Rust crate in `release` mode:\n"
msgstr "  Kamu juga bisa melakukan editable install sambil tetap mengompilasi Rust crate di bawahnya dalam mode `release`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Some features rely on optional dependencies. To install all of them, use the `all` extra:\n"
msgstr "  Beberapa fitur bergantung pada dependensi opsional. Untuk menginstal semuanya, gunakan extra `all`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Refer to the `[project.optional-dependencies]` section of [pyproject.toml](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-bosons/blob/main/pyproject.toml) to see which dependency groups are available.\n"
msgstr "  Lihat bagian `[project.optional-dependencies]` di [pyproject.toml](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-bosons/blob/main/pyproject.toml) untuk melihat grup dependensi apa saja yang tersedia.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can optionally verify that the installation was successful. The simplest test is to try and import one of the classes provided by the `qiskit-bosons` package, as in the following example:\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa memverifikasi secara opsional bahwa instalasi berhasil. Tes paling sederhana adalah mencoba mengimpor salah satu class yang disediakan paket `qiskit-bosons`, seperti pada contoh berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If this completes successfully, your installation worked.\n"
msgstr "Kalau ini selesai tanpa error, instalasimu berhasil.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can also run the entire Python test suite:\n"
msgstr "  Kamu juga bisa menjalankan seluruh test suite Python:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  To additionally run the tests that exercise optional dependencies, install the extras and use the `testoptional` target:\n"
msgstr "  Untuk menjalankan tambahan tes yang menguji dependensi opsional, instal extras dan gunakan target `testoptional`:\n"
